text = "Hello! My name is Richard Mandrake. I live in a small town located hidden in the depths of Evergreen Forest. Life is not easy for warrior people like us. Not only we have to hunt for food and we are responsible for safe guarding of our town. To keep threat away from the city we have a Hunter's guild which assigns tasks such as elimination of Orcs, Goblins, Skeleton Army and more. The population of these monsters is growing at a dangerous pace which is leading to more powerful monster waves.  "
